  "name": "E16. Grouped aggregate by key",
  "rawText": "# Question: Which product categories sell the most units per product?\n# Answer: Combines a root aggregate (Count) with a collection aggregate (Items.Sum) in one grouped query.\nProducts: Category,\n    Count(Id) ProductCount,\n    Items.Sum(Quantity) UnitsSold,\n    (Items.Sum(Quantity) * 1.0 / Count(Id)).Round(\u003C1\u003E) UnitsPerProduct\n  Order UnitsPerProduct DESC",
